# 3. Data Models and DTOs

All models are Pydantic `BaseModel` subclasses. Models in `src/models/` must import ONLY from `pydantic`, `datetime`, `uuid`, `enum`, and Python stdlib.

## 3.1 `ClipboardEntry` — `src/models/clipboard_entry.py`

```python
class ClipboardEntry(BaseModel):
    model_config = ConfigDict(frozen=True)

    id: str = Field(default_factory=lambda: str(uuid4()))
    text: str = Field(min_length=1)
    source_url: str = ""
    source_title: str = ""
    note: str = ""
    categories: list[str] = Field(default_factory=list)   # category IDs
    is_pinned: bool = False
    char_count: int = Field(ge=0)
    created_at: datetime = Field(default_factory=datetime.utcnow)
    updated_at: datetime = Field(default_factory=datetime.utcnow)

class ClipboardCategory(BaseModel):
    model_config = ConfigDict(frozen=True)

    id: str = Field(default_factory=lambda: str(uuid4()))
    name: str = Field(min_length=1, max_length=64)
    color: str = Field(default="#5B8DEF", pattern=r"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$")
    created_at: datetime = Field(default_factory=datetime.utcnow)
```

