# 12. Initialization and Shutdown Sequences

## 12.1 Initialization Steps (Detail)

| Step | Module | Action | Error Handling |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Logger | `setup_logging(data_dir, debug)` — creates log dir, configures sinks | Fatal if log dir cannot be created (exit 1) |
| 2 | ConfigManager | `__init__(config_dir)` → load `settings.json` → validate → fill defaults | Corrupted file → backup + regenerate from defaults; log WARNING |
| 3 | ThemeManager | `__init__(app, resources_dir)` → `apply_theme(config.appearance.theme)` | Missing QSS → apply hardcoded dark theme; log WARNING |
| 4 | AccessibilityManager | `__init__(config)` → detect screen reader → configure Qt a11y | Detection failure → default to disabled; log INFO |
| 5 | SplashScreen | `show()` | Cannot fail (QSplashScreen is simple) |
| 6 | SessionManager | `acquire_lock()` → `check_crash()` | Lock file conflict → show dialog: "Another instance may be running" |
| 7 | SessionManager | `recover_session()` if crash detected | Recovery failure → start fresh; log WARNING |
| 8 | WorkspaceManager | `__init__(data_dir)` → load active workspace from session | Missing workspace dir → recreate "default"; log WARNING |
| 9 | DatabaseManager | Open clipboard, bookmarks, history DBs for active workspace | DB corruption → recreate empty; log ERROR; notify user |
| 10 | BrowserProfileManager | `get_profile(active_workspace)` | Profile corruption → delete + recreate; log WARNING |
| 11 | ClipboardManager | `__init__(store)` — ClipboardStore binds to database | Store init failure → empty clipboard; log ERROR |
| 12 | TypingEngine | `__init__(simulator, speed_controller)` — state = IDLE | Cannot fail (no I/O) |
| 13 | HotkeyManager | `register_all(bindings)` | Per-key conflict → emit `hotkey_conflict`; skip conflicting key; log WARNING |
| 14 | SearchEngine | `register_source(clipboard)`, `register_source(bookmarks)` | Cannot fail |
| 15 | NotificationManager | `__init__()` | Cannot fail |
| 16 | UpdateManager | `check_for_updates()` — async on QThreadPool | Network error → silent; log DEBUG |
| 17 | PerformanceMonitor | `start()` | psutil unavailable → degrade gracefully; log INFO |
| 18 | MainWindow | `__init__(app_context)` → `show()` → hide splash | Geometry restore failure → default geometry; log WARNING |

## 12.2 Shutdown Steps (Detail)

| Step | Module | Action | Error Handling |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | MainWindow | `hide()` | Best effort |
| 2 | PerformanceMonitor | `stop()` | Best effort |
| 3 | UpdateManager | Cancel pending thread | Best effort |
| 4 | HotkeyManager | `unregister_all()` | Log WARNING on failure; continue |
| 5 | TypingEngine | `cancel()` → `_worker.wait(5000)` | Timeout → log WARNING "Worker abandoned" |
| 6 | SessionManager | `save_now()` → `release_lock()` | Save failure → log ERROR; continue |
| 7 | SearchEngine | (no persistent state) | — |
| 8 | ClipboardManager | Flush pending writes | DB write failure → log ERROR |
| 9 | BrowserProfileManager | `flush_profile()` | Best effort |
| 10 | WorkspaceManager | Save active workspace state | Write failure → log ERROR |
| 11 | DatabaseManager | `close_all()` | Best effort; log WARNING on error |
| 12 | NotificationManager | Dismiss all toasts | Best effort |
| 13 | ConfigManager | Flush pending writes | Write failure → log ERROR |
| 14 | Logger | Log "Graceful shutdown completed" → flush → close sinks | — |

