| `src/storage/*` | `sqlite3`, `json`, `src/models/*`, `src/platform/file_utils` (if needed) |
| `src/core/*` | `src/models/*`, `src/storage/*`, `src/platform/*` |
| `src/browser/*` | `src/models/*`, `src/storage/*`, `src/platform/*`, `src/core/events`, `src/core/protocols` |
