## 18.2 Forbidden Import Matrix

| Source Package | Must NEVER Import From | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| `src/models/*` | Any `src/` package | Models are pure data; no logic dependencies |
| `src/platform/*` | `src/core/*`, `src/browser/*`, `src/clipboard/*`, `src/typing/*`, `src/ui/*`, `src/storage/*` | Platform is the bottom layer |
| `src/storage/*` | `src/core/*`, `src/browser/*`, `src/clipboard/*`, `src/typing/*`, `src/ui/*` | Data layer doesn't know about business logic |
| `src/core/*` | `src/ui/*` | Core must not reference UI |
| `src/browser/*` | `src/clipboard/*`, `src/typing/*` | Domain modules are independent |
| `src/clipboard/*` | `src/browser/*`, `src/typing/*` | Domain modules are independent |
| `src/typing/*` | `src/browser/*`, `src/clipboard/*` | Domain modules are independent |
| Any module | `src/ui/main_window` (except `src/app.py`) | MainWindow is a leaf consumer |

